\boxed{3(7)^2+5(7)-1}
Let's evaluate the expression $3x^2+5x-1$ when $x=7$.
Replace $x$ with $7$ in the expression:
$$3(7)^2+5(7)-1 = 3(49) + 35 - 1 = 147 + 35 - 1 = 182 - 1 = 181$$
So, the value of the expression when $x=7$ is 181.

\boxed{181}
