$6d - 3 > 5d$
$6d - 5d > 3$
$d > 3$
Thus, the smallest integer $d$ such that $d > 3$ is $d=4$.
The total miles run by each girl is $6(4) - 3 = 24 - 3 = 21$ miles.
The total miles run by each boy is $5(4) = 20$ miles.
