The total miles run by the girls is $3 + 6(x-1)$.
The total miles run by the boys is $5x$.
We want $3 + 6(x-1) > 5x$.
$3 + 6x - 6 > 5x$
$6x - 3 > 5x$
$6x - 5x > 3$
$x > 3$
Since $x$ must be an integer, the smallest integer greater than 3 is 4.
So, they practice for 4 days.
The total miles run by girls is $3 + 6(4-1) = 3 + 6(3) = 3 + 18 = 21$ miles.
The total miles run by boys is $5(4) = 20$ miles.
